            <ArticleTitle>Managing pain in obese patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-32; quiz 33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000407601.90514.52</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Obesity has become an epidemic in American healthcare. Comorbidities such as diabetes and cardiac disease increase the mortality and morbidity for these patients. Obesity-related pain conditions can limit the patient's efforts at increasing activity and limit quality of life. This article will offer information on these conditions and treatment options.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
